{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1dyZWNrJTIwSXQlMjBSYWxwaCUyMCUyODIwMTIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Wreck It Ralph","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zWoIgZ7mgmPkaZjG0102BSKFIqQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3IFRjBDwtk0DlIsDfJ2zEzLjUBi.jpg","description":"Wreck-It Ralph is the 9-foot-tall, 643-pound villain of an arcade video game named Fix-It Felix Jr., in which the game's titular hero fixes buildings that Ralph destroys. Wanting to prove he can be a good guy and not just a villain, Ralph escapes his game and lands in Hero's Duty, a first-person shooter where he helps the game's hero battle against alien invaders. He later enters Sugar Rush, a kart racing game set on tracks made of candies, cookies and other sweets. There, Ralph meets Vanellope von Schweetz who has learned that her game is faced with a dire threat that could affect the entire arcade, and one that Ralph may have inadvertently started.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["Family","Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.4","runtime":"101 min","cast":["John C. Reilly","Sarah Silverman","Jack McBrayer","Jane Lynch","Alan Tudyk","Rich Moore","Raymond S. Persi","Mindy Kaling"],"director":["Rich Moore"],"released":"2012-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"When the game is over, the fun begins.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John C. Reilly","character":"Ralph (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iDQ8w4qcxU3le5ZWoCKpHs1QNok.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Silverman","character":"Vanellope (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/g5G711XyVokJm2RoItpkaHa8mkQ.jpg"},{"name":"Jack McBrayer","character":"Felix (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cbr26xDPEiOuYQxggtCPbu5xhDU.jpg"},{"name":"Jane Lynch","character":"Calhoun (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nye6D17ZfCHQzr9faYZYyz1CPsZ.jpg"},{"name":"Alan Tudyk","character":"King Candy (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.or